    "mean_target_contrast_delta_pct": -1.38,
    "ringing_anomaly_count": 0
  },
  "decision": {
    "verdict": "INSUFFICIENT EVIDENCE \u2014 REQUIRES DOWNSTREAM MODEL COMPARISON",
    "detailed_assessment": "INSUFFICIENT EVIDENCE: Only 4 of 20 representative swaths (20%) exhibited detectable directional spectral peaks (total peaks: 32). The AI4Shipwrecks dataset does not suffer from persistent thruster or motor electrical stripe banding. While target edge preservation remained high (98.88%) and contrast was essentially unaffected (-1.38%), the filter produced negligible noise reduction on typical swaths while introducing unnecessary computational overhead. Denoising should NOT be added to the default preprocessing pipeline.",
    "recommendation": "REMOVE / INSUFFICIENT EVIDENCE: Do not integrate directional stripe denoising into the production SONAR-INTEL pipeline. 1-99% swath-level percentile normalization remains the sole, robust baseline."
